/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:846:!!! Seats, custody and recovery
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:847:# ''Guardians and recovery.'' The enrolment shape stands ruled (#/rulings). Guardian count and threshold at enrolment, request authentication, the veto, a person's death and succession, the catastrophe rite and any third key, and a Handle's DNS binding stand open at <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/kahu#/seed-and-nexus">>.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:849:# ''Carriage across leaves.'' A guest-held carry-claim proven at the carry door would let carriage follow a guest across leaves — a second relation and a second domain. Lean: not built.
/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:860:# ''Removal's reach.'' The model stands ruled (#/rulings; <<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/kapae#/four-edges">>). Five questions stay the operator's, each with the house's lean. Whether an edge act may ever use the emergency class (lean: never). Whether a seated member under a member shadow keeps a seat's signature until the next roll (lean: yes, a seat leaves by a roll alone). What a recovery council holds after a mutual removal (lean: nothing built; the fork stands as the one exit). Whether a holder's key reads at its log's current head, so a recovered face keeps its edges (lean: yes, owed with the resolver of #/side-lanes). Whether a counted raise moves the keys while a lift still races it (lean: yes, remove-wins reaches the keys, and a lift then seats afresh). Two more came with the key side. What removes a seat no standing hand can revoke, the founding vessel's own among them (lean: a fresh group, at the re-founding that moves the PersonaGroup to a Keyhive group). Whether a vessel that holds no revoke authority goes on trying a raise until it sees the seat leave (lean: yes, and each try hands the roll on again, so the content key rolls whoever revokes the seat).
