/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/spirit-handback-canon-collision.mem:70:* ''Recovery re-admits'' — scoped to KEY-LOSS / impersonation. `the-veil-ladder` (line 132): //"recovery re-admits, never escrows a secret at rest (device re-admission, the G-recovery keel)"//; `persona-circle` (line 65) //"never resurrected… the cure is re-admission minting a fresh atom"//; `shelter-against-empire#the-honest-limit` (line 152) recovery relocates trust to a social layer. This invariant is about a ''lost/compromised key'', and it is real, ruled canon.
