/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/spirit-handback-canon-collision.mem:94:So canon simultaneously calls the grammar layer "fast" (composition ratchet) and "frozen-by-hash" (idempotent control surface). The model's three-tier cut RESOLVES this — grammar is frozen-advance-by-act, corpus is the fast layer — but canon has not chosen, and the two memes read against each other. ''The model forces the choice the memegraph has been carrying unresolved.''
